WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
- So, let's talk about
your new show though.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.680
It's called "The Endgame."

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:03.513
So what's it about?

00:00:03.513 --> 00:00:04.770
'Cause you play a badass. I like it.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.550
- You know, FBI agents
are very specific people,

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:09.490
and, you know, God love them,

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:12.670
because you have to put
your country and your job

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:15.193
pretty much before anything
and everybody else.

00:00:15.193 --> 00:00:17.300
And they do that for us.
They do that to keep us safe.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.360
You know, the Armed Services, the CIA,

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:20.193
the FBI.
- But the sacrifice

00:00:20.193 --> 00:00:21.290
for the family has to be hard.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.104
- It's hard. It's really
hard for them, you know?

00:00:24.104 --> 00:00:27.460
And so, it's an honor to be
able to go into that world.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:28.480
And obviously, this is a heightened

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:30.020
and explored version of that.

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:32.677
There's this, I call her
this sort of Carmen Sandiego,

00:00:32.677 --> 00:00:33.870
criminal mastermind.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:35.136
- Oh my god, I love that
you said Carmen Sandiego

00:00:35.136 --> 00:00:36.070
(Ryan laughing)

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:37.461
- Where in the world is she?
- Right?

00:00:37.461 --> 00:00:39.360
She's on our show. We found her.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:40.193
- [Kelly] I love it.

00:00:40.193 --> 00:00:42.140
- And she's lovely, and she's on our show.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:44.300
You know, it's like, who's bad?

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.720
Who's not? Is she bad?

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:47.553
Is she not?

00:00:47.553 --> 00:00:49.100
Is she like working for greater good?

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:50.520
Is she only working for herself?

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:54.150
And I'm the only one that
actually has any intel on her,

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:56.107
so I become the sort of centerpiece of-

00:00:56.107 --> 00:00:58.216
- [Kelly] The go to.
- Yeah, of this investigation.

00:00:58.216 --> 00:01:00.416
- That's so fun. What a cool show.

00:01:00.416 --> 00:01:02.253
- It's a really cool show.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

